| 方法 | 路径 | 用途 |
|---|---|---|
| POST | /api/requirements/{req_id}/archive | 发布链自动归档(R14) |
| GET | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge | 项目知识条目列表 |
| GET | /api/knowledge | 全平台知识条目(检索,FULLTEXT) |
| GET | /api/knowledge/{entry_id} | 详情 |
| PATCH | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge | 编辑(R14) |
| POST | /api/knowledge/{entry_id}/publish | 发布(R14) |
| POST | /api/knowledge/{entry_id}/promote | 转平台级(R14) |

### knowledge_bases.py — 知识库空间(/api,service:kb_service/kb_import_service)

| 方法 | 路径 | 用途 |
|---|---|---|
| GET | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge-bases | 空间列表(R20) |
| POST | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge-bases | 创建(blank/repo_import) |
| PATCH | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge-bases/{kb_id} | 修改 |
| DELETE | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge-bases/{kb_id} | 删除 |
| POST | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/import | 仓库导入(R20) |
| POST | /api/projects/{project_id}/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/sync | 快照同步(R20) |
| GET | /api/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/docs | 文档树 |
| POST | /api/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/docs | 新建文档 |
| PATCH | /api/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/docs/{doc_id} | 更新 |
| DELETE | /api/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/docs/{doc_id} | 删除 |
| GET | /api/knowledge-bases/{kb_id}/search | 空间内检索(FULLTEXT) |

